{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "6972edd8f625251a8c5bd94e4856606cf42e0b8b3e0c54f0bec6fe88e8b49b54", "ja": "因 ～Factors～", "zh": "因 ～Factors～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2e044b154b8dd81e1e696a104b3af01425ba1531a64a98306fed305f89075422", "ja": "プロデューサーが発注していた曲のデモが届\nいた。次回公演で披露するという、その歌い\n手に選ばれたのは、千早と静香。喜びつつも\n気おくれする静香に、千早は「あなたと歌い\nたい」と告げるのだった。", "zh": "制作人订购的歌曲样本送\n到了。据说将在下次公演中演出，获得歌手\n资格的是千早和静香。虽然很高兴，却有些\n畏缩的静香，千早对她说：“我想和你一起\n唱歌。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1f681a28151077f699103fd1d380013fa5005bc73329d53917ca925868f351cb", "ja": "（新曲のお披露目は、次の公演で行う事に決定。\n打ち合わせも兼ねて、メンバーに集まってもらった）", "zh": "（决定在下一场公演上进行新歌的首次公开演出。也算是为了开会，把成员们都叫来了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e050629f6c617c628b946d4a6ecff204ed41f09d3f61d889afd6942655d9a24c", "ja": "……というわけで、これがその新曲なんだ。", "zh": "……事情就是这样，这就是那首新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "25be76b8c9ffce3b15b046a3ea1187c8b40e119d556a5e9a218760d6fa1ba5b6", "ja": "わぁ……！", "zh": "哇……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "90b8fbb716d99fab8134ddbd0d1f951f19992cf529640e04719620c54365bdcf", "ja": "へえ……！", "zh": "哦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "e5f3c6ed92de3a21c1178f07421f88792d7f29247083a3540eb7d5aa93b6f029", "ja": "とってもカッコいいです！\nジュリアさん、こういうのがロックっていうんですか？", "zh": "特别帅气！\n茱莉亚先生，这就是所谓的摇滚吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "41419cfbb8679c80ebb58494501eca1afe9e0bc679dbb9a4b7de8cbf8eea1505", "ja": "ああ、めちゃくちゃロックだ！\nいいね、こういうの。鳥肌立っちまったよ！", "zh": "啊，太摇滚了！\n我喜欢这种感觉。都起鸡皮疙瘩了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "b3c672c92e356cbb3640ca1c49183e69612eadf4007b60ec10e8fb646f8075f4", "ja": "あははっ、チハもシズも、\nだいぶ気に入ったみたいだな？", "zh": "啊哈哈，千早和静香好像都相当喜欢嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "fce9ed3d5e6eec570bbd7b5587b7868062188004e5b28d05abe871b3e5ab6ef6", "ja": "えっ？　そ、そうですね！\nその、いい曲だと思います……。すごく。", "zh": "诶？确、确实是这样！\n那个，我觉得是首很棒的歌……真的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "c5feffd00649175590894489e05c8920574d5186ca3953cea9b8fc55bf9992aa", "ja": "{$P$}、この曲は誰が歌うんですか？\nもしかして……その……。", "zh": "{$P$}，这首歌要由谁来唱呢？\n难道说……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1014_002chi", "source_sha256": "56ca03b936a8f54c10439ec16cd7965a55837468ae518d7445b97cb9945d57b0", "ja": "あのっ！　歌いたいです……私。", "zh": "那个！我想唱……由我来唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "d1eacbaf37ad73d19b93d0a6304e7222189e2a7ba979474666af6b6052bd3c07", "ja": "おっ？", "zh": "哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "dd8725c207b3a5325fd44831462272300f37df0d7a97c985c607424bcfafa580", "ja": "……へえ、珍しいな。\n千早が自分から立候補してくれるなんて。", "zh": "……哎，真少见啊。\n千早居然会主动自荐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1019_002chi", "source_sha256": "1c54c8664f9aec26d44260a4ef9fb6462c712b6f120b8521b5a8720448fce5ab", "ja": "あっ……す、すみません！　つい……。\nもちろん、{$P$}にお任せします。", "zh": "啊……对、对不起！一不小心就……\n当然还是交给{$P$}先生了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "7ccf6b83059d2d543d58fe02cabbd14ac1fd9d5cc8fa9cae74bcc73e288d27e4", "ja": "いいんじゃないか？　チハならあたしも納得だ。\nでも……先を越されたな、シズ？", "zh": "挺好的不是吗？是千早的话我也心服口服。\n不过……被人抢先了一步呢，静香？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "c8ad7293ac5109cd06fa66a550e6c7be783668a948d50cc05f1d4c58763ced54", "ja": "えっ？　な、なに言ってるんですか！\n私は、別に……何も……。", "zh": "咦？你、你在说什么啊！\n我、我又没……什么都没有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "1332cef5af4ecdbf7b76f0d7b9bb4f528f5f8684f40173ce3c829077a4d968c5", "ja": "いや、誰に歌ってもらうかはもう決めてある。\n千早と、それから……静香。二人で歌ってくれ。", "zh": "不，由谁来唱我已经决定好了。\n千早，还有……静香。由你们两个人来唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "b75e83c3bf704dd467afa41c322efbd025e955fc6d619a19d05c8eafb8f0d071", "ja": "え？　……えええっ！？", "zh": "诶？……欸欸欸！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1024_002chi", "source_sha256": "27e44c5ee385cb1fe78353052dc5942bb296d79b84de3e9609e268c88cc8e8d8", "ja": "静香と……。\nわかりました。", "zh": "和静香……我明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "cae057682f16177f9e32f3542414a7275a0ad87fd3f2e2571da4b36b0642fee1", "ja": "ま、待ってください、{$P$}！\nつまり、千早さんと私の……デュオってことですか？", "zh": "等、等一下，{$P$}！也就是说，是千早小姐和我的……双人组合吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1026_p", "source_sha256": "40e2070e2f2dfa86a009645a18b5d0935746a8d3c8be384c152772839fab4383", "ja": "つまりも何も、そういうことだけど。\n問題でもあるのか？", "zh": "说什么是不是，就是这么回事。\n有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1027_015siz", "source_sha256": "c2c946b68f4c5039ec96716cb9e352e1bfb3af99742557b8bea30e7101812b33", "ja": "問題とかじゃ……。\nただ、あの……本当に、私でいいのかな、とか……。", "zh": "倒不是有什么问题……\n只是，那个……真的选我也没关系吗，之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "76ba88c89abf8ef91d2350d83308b40219ca0ce0ba9435329b453e85ed8ddd2b", "ja": "静香さん……？\nあの、わたしは、とっても楽しみですけど……？", "zh": "静香……？\n那个，我可是非常期待的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "1fc0f8b1e29a47d93d89ef2c7f13b133d3f5d90daf09905c6f20ca694a269f35", "ja": "やれやれ。覚悟を決めろよ、シズ。\n大丈夫、あたしが保証する♪", "zh": "真是的。做好心理准备吧，静。\n放心，有我担保♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "54399c76b92f64939d3f023de020d16ebd2c20c83476a50ca5ff0532821f77a8", "ja": "ほ、保証ってなんですか！　しかも気楽に……。\nだいたいジュリアさんこそ……、その……。", "zh": "什、什么叫保证啊！而且还说得那么轻松……再说了，茱莉亚先生才是……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1031_002chi", "source_sha256": "f161a3b51545d729a6a6a34cdb170129892b8c0c50c0b63c02050b516170aa63", "ja": "……静香。\n私は、あなたと歌いたい。", "zh": "……静香。\n我想和你一起唱歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "f2d65557e1880ccae6c586a00647a56ceb2a14451889cf993dcd561d0ecaf0ac", "ja": "えっ。\n千早さん……？", "zh": "咦。\n千早小姐……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1033_002chi", "source_sha256": "98d2ecd6882772135d56a5db421fe3a498985a0fb804f32bcf07d990386201ba", "ja": "この曲は、あなたと……\n一緒に歌ってみたいの。……お願い。", "zh": "这首歌，我想和你……一起唱唱看。……拜托了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1035_050jul", "source_sha256": "634acf857ee80db4b3230edf35bd05eee995826a6cc2284a4ff0358e7b76bf78", "ja": "……決まりだな。チハ、シズを頼むぜ！\nこの通り、たまに面倒くさいから覚悟しとけよ♪", "zh": "……决定了呢。千早，静香就交给你了！\n就像你看到的，她偶尔挺麻烦的，可要做好心理准备哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "0a0b47935baa3b23ee6d046de81d61225e30695bfdaff4e03e35aa9bfa3e5a36", "ja": "ちょ、ジュリアさん！？", "zh": "等等，茱莉亚先生！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1037_002chi", "source_sha256": "26fac6ef6f6ca6e3a8da1419742a6d6efc76f865e2fe8156a1957ef3fd600fa5", "ja": "ふふっ。……ありがとう、ジュリア。\n静香、いいかしら。", "zh": "呵呵……谢谢你，茱莉亚。\n静香，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1038_015siz", "source_sha256": "9196b7427ea7c2a6c97e8ffecadcf8a520529b162a3556c84fea55afed4a19c6", "ja": "あ、はいっ！　あの……、千早さんさえよければ。\nこちらこそ……よろしくお願いしますっ！", "zh": "啊，好的！那个……只要千早小姐愿意的话。\n我才是……请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1039_p", "source_sha256": "46365e415093ac54d3e0dcd6212f419eae08711146ac9b6f6b2ab5ac975facd7", "ja": "ふう、まとまったみたいでよかった。\nせっかくの新曲、披露できないともったいないからな。", "zh": "呼，看来总算谈妥了，太好了。\n难得有首新歌，要是没法演出就太可惜了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1040_p", "source_sha256": "e71934b391afbfe2f67d229a667ae9f4053dc3eb29e10c3f2b5a91b3fa47e1f6", "ja": "でも星梨花とジュリア、それからここにいる以外だと、\n志保が公演のメンバーだ。よろしく頼むぞ！", "zh": "不过，除了星梨花、茱莉亚以及在场的各位，还有志保也是公演成员。拜托大家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_01_1041_050jul", "source_sha256": "bb7beb77f8d0c3e536a3f1ca7879f8cdf89b8f79c77854d4ad15948bf0f236d1", "ja": "わかってるって！　星梨花、ウチらで\nチハとシズを食ってやろうな♪", "zh": "知道啦！星梨花，我们要靠咱们俩压过千早和静香哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
